dl8MjF_ldKGRe6t7a4PXHOiLc8pRU_z5tlrtkkcLrx4t9USZlpoibmJzSWK7Og5urw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXGjByeim8f6qX1paHtopkpVsjEcd02kHMSolIHJHzLQ&oe=69BAB337"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nGGzOr4TOwQ7kNvwEuiOi7&_nc_oc=AdmDwld1LeLuBvU8NI84Fs31-9sZtAWF4wighIC6VRv-ohRTq2QnbuZkQ_NUpYx6Txw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxFuqgkzQ-tUy-T_VUilJoaU0JvW9Dck_cJTfHKHAaFrA&oe=69BAB4CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kwik7HmvqiYQ7kNvwFCDVKC&_nc_oc=AdmxEd8ptmn1IV5PCQTDYZPkVS-1EAjRCTx74aOz5ZVOEaZow8bo8IiXW4womaxpQOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyCLr2uxAPMnXbHCsX1XDtqSiyyb_zh-20CzC99-10cxQ&oe=69BAA1EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZRcQ7q9Ds6EQ7kNvwGJgDKV&_nc_oc=Adm58ULPl3hbyjkLD1WMLnyFYN9GpbvPFoZwtIVN1m4hnkllTRccxHYch0tpi-WmMK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwB67r-qxMCl25wNg_LjKT2E7Lo1pRVYOQHonk3hpeb3g&oe=69BA8B43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wkTcCXY7qLUQ7kNvwF9PopM&_nc_oc=AdlRy2AzIxPpd_JhQdNECOouG7rLE9DOcByNJadcxO-n7GV-LcI6Mh03hz4OWUVIeiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyMUQqo4CHpMjs73EgmeksnyG5zo2fTRHum2tNC78nRZA&oe=69BA8398"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8YeVhwjeHAUQ7kNvwEK97Ob&_nc_oc=Adnjo9YESBUSNActk5ycHbaT15PBbNDS2MH1MMTnOK6-3pxbvqVK60ikskWw4Ndo5ZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyxftY7gzlA4atNAeXxOuhOrMIqqkPu1KIWgWFVEPuMbA&oe=69BA96BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&