2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QAxaY_lOJxAQ7kNvwH9Bzf3&_nc_oc=Adl8MjF_ldKGRe6t7a4PXHOiLc8pRU_z5tlrtkkcLrx4t9USZlpoibmJzSWK7Og5urw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwXGjByeim8f6qX1paHtopkpVsjEcd02kHMSolIHJHzLQ&oe=69BAB337"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7nGGzOr4TOwQ7kNvwEuiOi7&_nc_oc=AdmDwld1LeLuBvU8NI84Fs31-9sZtAWF4wighIC6VRv-ohRTq2QnbuZkQ_NUpYx6Txw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxFuqgkzQ-tUy-T_VUilJoaU0JvW9Dck_cJTfHKHAaFrA&oe=69BAB4CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kwik7HmvqiYQ7kNvwFCDVKC&_nc_oc=AdmxEd8ptmn1IV5PCQTDYZPkVS-1EAjRCTx74aOz5ZVOEaZow8bo8IiXW4womaxpQOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyCLr2uxAPMnXbHCsX1XDtqSiyyb_zh-20CzC99-10cxQ&oe=69BAA1EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 